thoughtrecipe tool_scope
"Tool-scoped run steps via 'may invoke' — the deny-by-default / scope anchor for Slice 4 (Q6/A-6). Every other recipe leaves ToolScopes null; this one exercises declared scopes AND an omitted-scope branch (the fail-closed case the refactor must make deny rather than allow)."

trigger as capability:
  may read workspace
  may invoke ["file_read"]

agent reviewer uses react

run reviewer:
  may invoke ["file_read", "grep"]
  from input.workspace
  goal "Read and search the workspace."
  capture result -> state.findings

route:
  when state.findings contains urgent:
    run reviewer:
      may invoke ["file_write"]
      goal "Apply an urgent fix."
  otherwise:
    run reviewer:
      goal "No scope declared in this branch — anchors the omitted-scope case."
